WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
Yes, the mission is to climb to the top of Jinding Mountain

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,320
Then what?

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,520
no then

4
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,320
Just climb to the top of Jinding Mountain

5
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,320
Forty-eight hours on the seventh line

6
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:11,380
It seems I'm overthinking

7
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:14,820
I thought I had to do something on the top of the mountain, Uncle Chen

8
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:17,420
Are the tasks of this system becoming more and more irregular?

9
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:18,420
drive a tank

10
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,540
Underwater Huangling Fog

11
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,740
This time it’s mountain climbing again

12
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:21,780
Jump too big

13
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:22,780
no relation

14
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,940
It seems like it’s a bug. The mission is random.

15
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,700
Rewards are also random

16
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,060
But the more this happens

17
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:31,020
The more you can't take it lightly, just climb a mountain if nothing happens.

18
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,820
Why should I leave now?

19
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,100
It's only two o'clock in the afternoon
